  "theorem_statement": "W(3,3) observables are organized by a two-layer algebra: a mixer layer generated by C=8/13, T=5/13, D=C-T=3/13, and a projection layer generated by P(A)=A/Phi3.  The layers intersect uniquely at 10/13, where the mixer complement 1-D equals the carrier-field projection P(Phi4).",
